 "purpose": "What each PDF in data/dev is, so the clerk and the dev runs use only in-scope cases (D-001: NCLT and NCLAT proceedings). Files are never moved or edited; this list classifies them. Precedent-DB overlap for each dev case is in data/sealed/dev_overlap_manifest.json.",
 "statuses": {
  "DEV_CASE": "In scope (NCLAT appeal, or SC appeal under s.62, D-061); may be clerked and simulated",
